Implement Apple xnu type traits in upstream clang

Adds __builtin_xnu_type_signature, __builtin_xnu_type_summary,
__builtin_xnu_types_compatible and __attribute__((xnu_usage_semantics())).

Upstream base: https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project
               branch main, commit 58c46bae21181fb4240cf964461bea738d96d50e (apt.llvm.org snapshot 24~++20260911085248)

